{
  "id": "school-festival",
  "title": "園遊會擺攤",
  "titleEn": "Running a Booth at the School Festival",
  "category": "校園活動",
  "level": "中級",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/school-festival.webp",
    "alt": "在熱鬧的學校園遊會操場上，幾位國中生在班級攤位前分工合作，熱情地招呼客人並遞上自製點心與遊戲票券。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Today, every "
        },
        {
          "text": "student",
          "wordIds": [
            "student"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " is excited because our school is holding its annual "
        },
        {
          "text": "festival",
          "wordIds": [
            "festival"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "今天每位學生都很興奮，因為學校正在舉辦一年一度的園遊會。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Our class sets up a colorful "
        },
        {
          "text": "booth",
          "wordIds": [
            "booth"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to "
        },
        {
          "text": "sell",
          "wordIds": [
            "sell"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " handmade cookies and fun games."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "我們班設立了一個色彩繽紛的攤位，販售手工餅乾和好玩的遊戲。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "When visitors walk by, Mia waves happily and calls out, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Welcome to our ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "welcome-to-our-booth"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "booth",
          "phraseIds": [
            "welcome-to-our-booth"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "booth"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "welcome-to-our-booth"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "當訪客走過時，Mia 開心地揮手並喊道：「歡迎來到我們的攤位！」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "A friendly "
        },
        {
          "text": "customer",
          "wordIds": [
            "customer"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " stops at our table to look around."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "一位親切的客人停在我們的桌子前東張西望。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo points to our fresh treats and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Would you like to try one?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "would-you-like-to-try-one"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 指著我們新鮮的點心問道：「你想嚐嚐看嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The customer smiles and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "One ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "one-ticket-please"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ticket",
          "phraseIds": [
            "one-ticket-please"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "ticket"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", please.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "one-ticket-please"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "客人微笑著說：「請給我一張票。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "After handing over the snack, the students wave and say, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thanks for coming!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "thanks-for-coming"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "遞上點心後，學生們揮手說道：「謝謝光臨！」"
    }
  ],
